## Data Model

Lyrics are stored in the `lyrics` table with multi-language and variant support:

| Field | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `track_id` | Reference to the track |
| `language` | Language code (`en`, `id`, `jp`, etc.) |
| `variant` | `original`, `translated`, `romanized`, `synced` |
| `content` | The lyrics text content |

## API Endpoints

```
GET /tracks/:id/lyrics    → Get lyrics for a track
POST /tracks/:id/lyrics   → Add a lyrics variant
GET /lyrics/:id           → Get lyrics by ID
DELETE /lyrics/:lyricId   → Delete a lyrics entry
```

## Sources

Lyrics are fetched from **Genius** via the `genius-lyrics` package during the scraping process.

## Multiple Variants

A single track can have multiple lyrics entries:
- Original language lyrics
- Translated versions
- Romanized versions (for non-Latin scripts)
- Time-synced lyrics (for karaoke-style display)
